@startuml
actor User
participant "UI (View)" as View
participant "WeatherBloc" as Bloc
participant "GetWeather (Usecase)" as Usecase
participant "WeatherRepository" as Repository
participant "RemoteDataSource" as DataSource
database "Weather API" as API

User -> View: Enters city name and taps search
View -> Bloc: Add GetWeatherEvent
Bloc -> Usecase: execute(cityName)
Usecase -> Repository: getWeather(cityName)
Repository -> DataSource: getWeather(cityName)
DataSource -> API: GET request
API --> DataSource: JSON response
DataSource --> Repository: WeatherModel
Repository --> Usecase: Weather Entity
Usecase --> Bloc: Either<Failure, Weather>
Bloc -> Bloc: Emits WeatherLoaded or WeatherError state
Bloc --> View: New State
View -> View: Rebuilds UI with data or error
View --> User: Displays weather information or error message
@enduml
